      "title": "MaskingPolicy",
      "description": "The masked-language-modelling policy; of the selected tokens a fraction is replaced by the vocabulary's mask token, a fraction by a random token and the rest kept, 80/10/10 (epic:bert-from-scratch). The three fractions sum to 1, which ESS does not state here. Draws use the Philox key/counter derivation (DESIGN.md § 2.3).",
